{"body": {"ayah": 33, "surah": 33, "text_en": "Indeed, Allah desires only to remove from you all impurity, O People of the Household, and to purify you with a thorough purification."}, "confidence": 1.0, "content_level": null, "first_seen": {"book": "mabda-maad-gh-2022-augment", "chapter": "lec04", "date": "2026-06-15"}, "id": "quran:33:33", "sources": [{"book": "mabda-maad-gh-2022-augment", "chapter": "lec04", "locator": null}], "tradition": "universal", "type": "quran", "variants": []}
{"body": {"ayah": 38, "surah": 36, "text_en": "That is the decree of the Exalted in Might, the All-Knowing"}, "confidence": 1.0, "content_level": null, "first_seen": {"book": "mabda-maad-gh-2022-augment", "chapter": "lec09", "date": "2026-06-15"}, "id": "quran:36:38", "sources": [{"book": "mabda-maad-gh-2022-augment", "chapter": "lec09", "locator": null}], "tradition": "universal", "type": "quran", "variants": []}
{"body": {"ayah": 18, "surah": 3, "text_en": "Allah witnesses that there is no deity except Him"}, "confidence": 1.0, "content_level": null, "first_seen": {"book": "mabda-maad-gh-2022-augment", "chapter": "lec09", "date": "2026-06-15"}, "id": "quran:3:18", "sources": [{"book": "mabda-maad-gh-2022-augment", "chapter": "lec09", "locator": null}], "tradition": "universal", "type": "quran", "variants": []}
{"body": {"ayah": 24, "surah": 3, "text_en": "That is because they said, \"Never will the Fire touch us, except for a few numbered days,\" and they were deluded in their religion by what they used to invent."}, "confidence": 1.0, "content_level": null, "first_seen": {"book": "ibrahim-2015-augment", "chapter": "lec16", "date": "2026-06-15"}, "id": "quran:3:24", "sources": [{"book": "ibrahim-2015-augment", "chapter": "lec16", "locator": null}], "tradition": "universal", "type": "quran", "variants": []}
{"body": {"ayah": 25, "surah": 3, "text_en": "So how will it be when We gather them for a Day about which there is no doubt, and every soul will be compensated for what it earned, and they will not be wronged?"}, "confidence": 1.0, "content_level": null, "first_seen": {"book": "ibrahim-2015-augment", "chapter": "lec16", "date": "2026-06-15"}, "id": "quran:3:25", "sources": [{"book": "ibrahim-2015-augment", "chapter": "lec16", "locator": null}], "tradition": "universal", "type": "quran", "variants": []}
{"body": {"ayah": 26, "surah": 3, "text_en": "Say, \"O Allah, Owner of Sovereignty, You give sovereignty to whom You will and You take sovereignty away from whom You will. You honor whom You will and You humble whom You will. In Your hand is [all] good. Indeed, You are over all things competent\"."}, "confidence": 1.0, "content_level": null, "first_seen": {"book": "ibrahim-2015-augment", "chapter": "lec16", "date": "2026-06-15"}, "id": "quran:3:26", "sources": [{"book": "ibrahim-2015-augment", "chapter": "lec16", "locator": null}], "tradition": "universal", "type": "quran", "variants": []}
{"body": {"ayah": 55, "surah": 3, "text_en": "When Allah said, \"O Isa, indeed I will take you and raise you to Myself and purify you from those who disbelieve and make those who follow you superior to those who disbelieve until the Day of Resurrection.\""}, "confidence": 1.0, "content_level": null, "first_seen": {"book": "ibrahim-2015-augment", "chapter": "lec19", "date": "2026-06-15"}, "id": "quran:3:55", "sources": [{"book": "ibrahim-2015-augment", "chapter": "lec19", "locator": null}], "tradition": "universal", "type": "quran", "variants": []}
{"body": {"ayah": 7, "surah": 3, "text_en": "and no one knows its interpretation except Allah and those well-grounded in knowledge"}, "confidence": 1.0, "content_level": null, "first_seen": {"book": "ibrahim-2015-augment", "chapter": "lec13", "date": "2026-06-15"}, "id": "quran:3:7", "sources": [{"book": "ibrahim-2015-augment", "chapter": "lec13", "locator": null}], "tradition": "universal", "type": "quran", "variants": []}
{"body": {"ayah": 79, "surah": 3, "text_en": "It is not for a human [prophet] that Allah should give him the Scripture and authority and prophethood and then he would say to the people, 'Be servants to me rather than Allah.' Rather, [he would say], 'Be pious scholars of the Lord because of what you have taught of the Scripture and because of what you have studied.'"}, "confidence": 1.0, "content_level": null, "first_seen": {"book": "ibrahim-2015-augment", "chapter": "lec22", "date": "2026-06-15"}, "id": "quran:3:79", "sources": [{"book": "ibrahim-2015-augment", "chapter": "lec22", "locator": null}], "tradition": "universal", "type": "quran", "variants": []}
{"body": {"ayah": 8, "surah": 3, "text_en": "Our Lord, let not our hearts deviate after You have guided us, and grant us from Yourself mercy. Indeed, You are the Bestower"}, "confidence": 1.0, "content_level": null, "first_seen": {"book": "ibrahim-2015-augment", "chapter": "lec13", "date": "2026-06-15"}, "id": "quran:3:8", "sources": [{"book": "ibrahim-2015-augment", "chapter": "lec13", "locator": null}], "tradition": "universal", "type": "quran", "variants": []}
{"body": {"ayah": 80, "surah": 3, "text_en": "And he would not order you to take the angels and prophets as lords. Would he order you to disbelief after you had submitted?"}, "confidence": 1.0, "content_level": null, "first_seen": {"book": "ibrahim-2015-augment", "chapter": "lec22", "date": "2026-06-15"}, "id": "quran:3:80", "sources": [{"book": "ibrahim-2015-augment", "chapter": "lec22", "locator": null}], "tradition": "universal", "type": "quran", "variants": []}
{"body": {"ayah": 81, "surah": 3, "text_en": "And [recall] when Allah took the covenant of the prophets, [saying], \"Whatever I give you of the Scripture and wisdom and then there comes to you a messenger confirming what is with you, you [must] believe in him and support him.\""}, "confidence": 1.0, "content_level": null, "first_seen": {"book": "ibrahim-2015-augment", "chapter": "lec22", "date": "2026-06-15"}, "id": "quran:3:81", "sources": [{"book": "ibrahim-2015-augment", "chapter": "lec22", "locator": null}], "tradition": "universal", "type": "quran", "variants": []}
{"body": {"ayah": 82, "surah": 3, "text_en": "He said, \"Have you acknowledged and taken upon that My commitment?\" They said, \"We have acknowledged.\" He said, \"Then bear witness, and I am with you among the witnesses.\""}, "confidence": 1.0, "content_level": null, "first_seen": {"book": "ibrahim-2015-augment", "chapter": "lec22", "date": "2026-06-15"}, "id": "quran:3:82", "sources": [{"book": "ibrahim-2015-augment", "chapter": "lec22", "locator": null}], "tradition": "universal", "type": "quran", "variants": []}
{"body": {"ayah": 83, "surah": 3, "text_en": "And whoever turns away after that - then those are the defiantly disobedient."}, "confidence": 1.0, "content_level": null, "first_seen": {"book": "ibrahim-2015-augment", "chapter": "lec22", "date": "2026-06-15"}, "id": "quran:3:83", "sources": [{"book": "ibrahim-2015-augment", "chapter": "lec22", "locator": null}], "tradition": "universal", "type": "quran", "variants": []}
{"body": {"ayah": 9, "surah": 3, "text_en": "Our Lord, surely You will gather the people for a Day about which there is no doubt. Indeed, Allah does not fail in His promise"}, "confidence": 1.0, "content_level": null, "first_seen": {"book": "ibrahim-2015-augment", "chapter": "lec13", "date": "2026-06-15"}, "id": "quran:3:9", "sources": [{"book": "ibrahim-2015-augment", "chapter": "lec13", "locator": null}], "tradition": "universal", "type": "quran", "variants": []}
{"body": {"ayah": 92, "surah": 3, "text_en": "You will not attain righteousness until you spend from that which you love. And whatever you spend - indeed, Allah is Knowing of it."}, "confidence": 1.0, "content_level": null, "first_seen": {"book": "ibrahim-2015-augment", "chapter": "lec23", "date": "2026-06-15"}, "id": "quran:3:92", "sources": [{"book": "ibrahim-2015-augment", "chapter": "lec23", "locator": null}], "tradition": "universal", "type": "quran", "variants": []}
{"body": {"ayah": 93, "surah": 3, "text_en": "All food was lawful to the Children of Israel except what Israel had made unlawful to himself before the Torah was revealed. Say, \"So bring the Torah and recite it, if you should be truthful.\""}, "confidence": 1.0, "content_level": null, "first_seen": {"book": "ibrahim-2015-augment", "chapter": "lec23", "date": "2026-06-15"}, "id": "quran:3:93", "sources": [{"book": "ibrahim-2015-augment", "chapter": "lec23", "locator": null}], "tradition": "universal", "type": "quran", "variants": []}
{"body": {"ayah": 94, "surah": 3, "text_en": "Then whoever invents falsehood about Allah after that - it is those who are the wrongdoers."}, "confidence": 1.0, "content_level": null, "first_seen": {"book": "ibrahim-2015-augment", "chapter": "lec23", "date": "2026-06-15"}, "id": "quran:3:94", "sources": [{"book": "ibrahim-2015-augment", "chapter": "lec23", "locator": null}], "tradition": "universal", "type": "quran", "variants": []}
